{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\nIf you're looking for a sweet and gentle companion with big soulful eyes, look no further than Lilypad. Lilypad's favorite place to be is curled up right next to you. Lilypad warmed up quickly to her foster home and with each day wanted more love and affection. She likes lots of pets, chin scratches, and being brushed. The more you get to know Lilypad, the louder her purr will become. Her big eyes make her look a little sad sometimes, but Lilypad is very content spending her day curled up snoozing on the couch. She is very quiet, and her 'meow' that she greets you with when you come home is really more of a little squeak.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=7&searchType=4&animalid=199892","id":"f4ec3ecfbb2d05593a2dd9fe2b0e352b","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/a63342736a2b4533b75f58269dadbdc1-1780682909-1780682918-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/07ac51b193c14512a05000edb6c17c38-1780682909-1780682909-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e448df1f24da4dc88a0fdf552063c88c-1780682909-1780682909-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e487d708363b4c858a960bc8cefe77b7-1778850476-1778850476-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5d2c8d5bb9de4adaa0c1739b05063283-1778642177-1778642177-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/09dbea5526864c84adbffb4eee241db1-1777601768-1777601768-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/f4fb7f748562480f8eb5950cc1ada985-1777433945-1777433979-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/998607843e064a7090160